---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import schemaData from '../data-schema.json';
const schema = JSON.stringify(schemaData);
---
<Base title="Blush Nail Room | Slim extensions, BIAB and 3D nail art in Worthing" description="Sculpted slim extensions, BIAB and 3D nail art by Madalina at Blush Nail Room, inside Amour Hair Co., Broadwater, Worthing. Every set starts with a Russian manicure. Book on Fresha." schema={schema}>
<main id="top">

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="art">
        <div class="nailframe me"><img src="/images/me.webp" alt="Madalina, the nail tech behind Blush Nail Room" width="1100" height="1188" fetchpriority="high"></div>
        <div class="seal" aria-hidden="true"><span class="logo"></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="notch">
        <p class="display">Nails that look this good, without wrecking the ones underneath.</p>
        <h1>Sculpted slim extensions, BIAB and 3D nail art by Madalina, in Broadwater, Worthing.</h1>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn" href="https://l.fresha.com/30x4xv43y">Book on Fresha</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="#prices">See prices</a>
        </div>
        <a class="proof" href="#reviews"><b aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</b><span>5-star reviews on Google and Fresha</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="facts" aria-label="What to expect">
    <div class="wrap">
      <ul>
        <li>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 35V16c0-7 3.2-11.5 7-11.5S27 9 27 16v19"/><path d="M13 29c2.2 2 4.4 3 7 3s4.800-1 7-3"/></svg>
          <div><strong>A Russian manicure with every set</strong><span>Precise cuticle work before any colour goes on.</span></div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 33S7 25.5 7 15.800A6.800 6.800 0 0 1 20 13a6.800 6.800 0 0 1 13 2.800C33 25.500 20 33 20 33z"/></svg>
          <div><strong>Free repairs within 7 days</strong><span>If a nail breaks in the first week, I’ll fix it.</span></div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="9" width="28" height="25" rx="2"/><path d="M6 16h28M13 5v7M27 5v7M14 24l4.200 4.200L26.500 20"/></svg>
          <div><strong>Book online in a minute</strong><span>Instant confirmation, and your £10 deposit comes off the total.</span></div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band blush">
    <div class="wrap standard">
      <div>
        <p class="stance">Pretty nails should never cost you healthy natural nails.</p>
        <p>Every set starts with a Russian manicure, so your colour sits right at the base and grows out beautifully. Then the structure is built properly, with a balanced shape and apex and thin, even product.</p>
        <p>I’m a proud perfectionist, so I never rush the parts other techs skip.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>The parts other techs skip</h2>
        <ul class="skip">
          <li><strong>Careful cuticle prep</strong><span>The cuticle area is cleaned up precisely, so colour sits right at the base.</span></li>
          <li><strong>A balanced shape and apex</strong><span>Strength built in where your nail needs it, so the set lasts.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Thin, even product</strong><span>Length and strength without the bulky, fake look.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Clean sidewalls</strong><span>Edges you’d happily show off up close.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" id="services">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>What I do</h2>
      <p class="lede">I love doing it all, but these are what clients come to me for.</p>
      <div class="svc">
        <article>
          <div class="nailframe"><img src="/images/slim.webp" alt="Long slim almond extensions with gold leaf and autumn-toned art" loading="lazy" width="720" height="1280" style="object-position:50% 40%"></div>
          <div>
            <h3>Sculpted slim extensions</h3>
            <p class="meta">£55, about 2 hrs 30</p>
            <p>Length and strength without the bulky, fake look. A refined, slim structure with cuticle prep and colour.</p>
            <a class="textlink" href="https://www.fresha.com/a/blushnailroom-worthing-7-broadwater-street-east-o2xszsjq/booking?offerItemId=s:26262958">Book slim extensions</a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="nailframe"><img src="/images/biab.webp" alt="Short natural nails in a milky nude BIAB" loading="lazy" width="760" height="1013"></div>
          <div>
            <h3>BIAB on natural nails</h3>
            <p class="meta">£38, about 1 hr</p>
            <p>A strengthening overlay on your own nails, with a Russian manicure and colour. BIAB extensions for added length are £45.</p>
            <a class="textlink" href="https://www.fresha.com/a/blushnailroom-worthing-7-broadwater-street-east-o2xszsjq/booking?offerItemId=s:26262936">Book BIAB</a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="nailframe"><img src="/images/art.webp" alt="Sculpted 3D butterfly-wing extensions in pink and black" loading="lazy" width="760" height="1013"></div>
          <div>
            <h3>Nail art</h3>
            <p class="meta">From +£5 a set</p>
            <p>Chrome, French and dots through to sculpted 3D charms and characters, added to any treatment by tier.</p>
            <a class="textlink" href="#prices">See the nail art tiers</a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="nailframe"><img src="/images/russian.webp" alt="Short square French manicure with a clean cuticle line" loading="lazy" width="760" height="1013"></div>
          <div>
            <h3>Russian manicure</h3>
            <p class="meta">Gel manicure £28, about 35 mins</p>
            <p>Cleans up the cuticle area so precisely that your colour sits right at the base and grows out beautifully.</p>
            <a class="textlink" href="https://www.fresha.com/a/blushnailroom-worthing-7-broadwater-street-east-o2xszsjq/booking?offerItemId=s:26262931">Book a gel manicure</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band beige" id="prices">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Prices</h2>
      <p class="lede">Choose your treatment, then add nail art by tier, so you know the cost before you sit down.</p>
      <div class="prices">
        <div class="tiers notch">
          <p class="caps">Nail art tiers</p>
          <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Tier 1</span><small>One design type: chrome, French or polka dots</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">+£5</span></div>
          <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Tier 2</span><small>Two design types, like French and chrome</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">+£10</span></div>
          <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Tier 3</span><small>Three design types, or simple 3D art</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">+£15</span></div>
          <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Tier 4</span><small>Four or more design types and sculpted 3D characters</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">from +£20</span></div>
          <p class="sum">For example, BIAB on natural nails at £38 with Tier 2 art at £10 comes to £48.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="list">
            <details open><summary><span class="caps">Manicure treatments</span></summary><div class="rows">
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Gel Manicure</span><small>Russian manicure, shape and gel colour. About 35 mins.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">£28</span></div>
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">BIAB on Natural Nails</span><small>Russian manicure, strengthening overlay and colour. About 1 hr.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">£38</span></div>
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Gel Removal with New Manicure</span><small>Add-on: removes your existing gel before your new manicure.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">+£5</span></div>
            </div></details>
            <details><summary><span class="caps">Nail extensions</span></summary><div class="rows">
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Sculpted Slim Nail Extensions</span><small>Refined slim structure, cuticle prep and colour. About 2 hrs 30.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">£55</span></div>
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">BIAB Extensions</span><small>Added length with BIAB, Russian manicure and colour. About 1 hr 20.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">£45</span></div>
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Polygel Extensions</span><small>Added length, Russian manicure and colour. About 1 hr 20.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">£45</span></div>
            </div></details>
            <details><summary><span class="caps">Infills</span></summary><div class="rows">
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">BIAB Infill</span><small>Cuticle work, rebalance and fresh colour. About 1 hr.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">£35</span></div>
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Polygel Infill</span><small>Regrowth refresh, reshaping and colour. About 1 hr.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">£40</span></div>
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Sculpted Slim Nail Infill</span><small>Restore shape and balance, cuticle work and colour. About 1 hr 45.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">£45</span></div>
            </div></details>
            <details><summary><span class="caps">Removal and repairs</span></summary><div class="rows">
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">BIAB or Polygel Removal Before New Set</span><small>Add-on: removes existing BIAB or polygel before your new set.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">+£10</span></div>
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Gel Removal and Tidy</span><small>Gel polish removal and natural nail shaping.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">£12</span></div>
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">BIAB or Polygel Removal and Tidy</span><small>Product removal and a neat natural finish.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">£15</span></div>
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Single Nail Repair</span><small>Repair or rebuild to match your set. Free within 7 days.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">from £5</span></div>
            </div></details>
            <details><summary><span class="caps">Pedicures</span></summary><div class="rows">
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Express Gel Pedicure</span><small>Cutting, shaping and gel colour of choice. About 30 mins.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">£30</span></div>
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Deluxe Pedicure</span><small>Express, plus foot scrub, massage and hot towels. About 1 hr.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">£40</span></div>
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Gel Removal with New Pedicure</span><small>Add-on: removes your existing gel before your pedicure.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">+£5</span></div>
            </div></details>
            <details><summary><span class="caps">Toenail extensions</span></summary><div class="rows">
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Polygel Toenail Extension, full set</span><small>A neat, strong square, or your shape of choice, in polygel.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">£43</span></div>
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Polygel Toenail Infill, full set</span><small>Infill and rebalance to refresh shape and structure.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">£35</span></div>
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Individual Toenail Extension</span></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">£6</span></div>
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Both Big Toenails Extension</span></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">£12</span></div>
              <div class="row"><div class="txt"><span class="name">Toenail Extension, add-on to pedicure</span><small>Per toe, added to your pedicure.</small></div><span class="dots"></span><span class="amt">+£5</span></div>
            </div></details>
          </div>
          <div class="after"><a class="btn" href="https://l.fresha.com/30x4xv43y">Book on Fresha</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" id="work">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Recent sets</h2>
      <p class="lede">Every photo is real, with no filters or retouching. What you see is what you’ll leave with.</p>
      <div class="gal">
        <figure><img src="/images/g1.webp" alt="Almond nails in pastel colours with fried egg art" loading="lazy" width="720" height="824"></figure>
        <figure><img src="/images/g2.webp" alt="Nude almond nails with gold 3D accents" loading="lazy" width="720" height="960"></figure>
        <figure><img src="/images/g3.webp" alt="Long slim almond extensions with gold 3D coils and black hand-painted tips" loading="lazy" width="760" height="807"></figure>
        <figure><img src="/images/g4.webp" alt="Short square nails with hand-painted cartoon art" loading="lazy" width="720" height="960"></figure>
        <figure><img src="/images/g5.webp" alt="Almond nails with orange tips and gold outline art" loading="lazy" width="720" height="1280"></figure>
        <figure><img src="/images/g6.webp" alt="Square extensions with 3D bows, chrome and Christmas art" loading="lazy" width="720" height="960"></figure>
        <figure><img src="/images/g7.webp" alt="Bridal set: long square white French tips, photographed with the bride’s veil" loading="lazy" width="720" height="960"></figure>
        <figure><img src="/images/g8.webp" alt="Square nails in a soft pink and white ombré" loading="lazy" width="720" height="960"></figure>
      </div>
      <div class="after"><a class="textlink" href="https://www.instagram.com/blushnailroom_/">See more on Instagram</a><a class="textlink" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@blushnailroom1">Watch on TikTok</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band beige" id="about">
    <div class="wrap about">
      <div class="ph"><img src="/images/room.webp" alt="Madalina at her nail desk in the Blush room, holding a fan of colour swatches" loading="lazy" width="1040" height="1387"></div>
      <div>
        <h2>Hi, I’m Madalina</h2>
        <p>I’m the nail tech behind Blush Nail Room, tucked inside Amour Hair Co. on Broadwater Street East in Worthing. I trained in Moldova, then started out doing nails on myself and my friends, and soon for people I knew. I’ve been hooked on getting every tiny detail right ever since.</p>
        <p>I love doing it all, from BIAB to sculpted 3D art, but slim extensions and Russian manicure are my signature.</p>
        <blockquote>When you leave my chair, I want you to feel polished, looked after and confident every time you catch sight of your hands, like you’ve just had an hour that was completely about you.</blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" id="reviews">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>What clients say</h2>
      <div class="quotes">
        <figure class="quote notch"><div class="stars" role="img" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</div><p>“She has genuinely revived my nails and delivered exactly what I had in mind.”</p><cite>Google review</cite></figure>
        <figure class="quote notch"><div class="stars" role="img" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</div><p>“The attention to detail is brilliant, and you can really tell how much care and effort goes into every set of nails.”</p><cite>Google review</cite></figure>
        <figure class="quote notch"><div class="stars" role="img" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</div><p>“Madalina was very knowledgeable and professional and did a great manicure!”</p><cite>Anna, Fresha review</cite></figure>
      </div>
      <div class="after">
        <a class="btn" href="https://l.fresha.com/30x4xv43y">Book on Fresha</a>
        <a class="textlink" href="https://www.fresha.com/a/blushnailroom-worthing-7-broadwater-street-east-o2xszsjq">Read reviews on Fresha</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band blush" id="booking">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>How booking works</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><strong>Pick your treatment and art tier</strong><span>Book the treatment plus the tier that matches your design. Detailed or 3D designs need booking in advance.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Pay a £10 deposit</strong><span>It secures your appointment and comes off your total. With 48 hours’ notice, it moves with you to a new date.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Tell me what you’re wearing</strong><span>If you have gel, BIAB or polygel from another tech, add removal to your booking: £5 for gel, £10 for BIAB or polygel.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="small">Running late? There’s a 15-minute grace period, so just let me know. Missed appointments without notice are charged in full, with your deposit counting towards it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" id="faq">
    <div class="wrap faqwrap">
      <div>
        <h2>Questions clients ask</h2>
        <p class="lede">Can’t see yours? <a class="textlink" href="https://www.instagram.com/blushnailroom_/">Message me on Instagram</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq">
        <details><summary>How long will my nails last?</summary><p>Your set is made to last until your infill, which is usually every 3 to 4 weeks. If a nail breaks within 7 days of your appointment, the repair is free.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What’s the difference between BIAB, gel and extensions?</summary><p>Gel is a thin layer of colour on your natural nail. BIAB is a builder gel that strengthens your own nails. Extensions add length, in BIAB, polygel or as sculpted slim extensions.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What is a Russian manicure, and does it hurt?</summary><p>It’s precise cuticle work that cleans up the cuticle area, so your colour sits right at the base and grows out beautifully. It shouldn’t hurt, and if anything feels uncomfortable, just tell me.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Will slim extensions look natural or bulky?</summary><p>Natural. A slim, sculpted extension gives you length and strength without the bulky, fake look.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How long does an appointment take?</summary><p>A gel manicure takes about 35 minutes, BIAB on natural nails about an hour, and sculpted slim extensions about 2 hours 30 minutes. Nail art adds 10 to 35 minutes, depending on the tier.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Do I need to come in with my old set removed?</summary><p>No, I’ll remove it for you. Tell me before booking and add removal to your appointment: £5 for gel, or £10 for BIAB or polygel.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How often should I book infills?</summary><p>Every 3 to 4 weeks for most clients. Infills are £35 for BIAB, £40 for polygel and £45 for sculpted slim nails.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Will it damage my natural nails?</summary><p>Not when it’s done properly. Careful prep, thin, even product and safe removals protect your natural nails. Please tell me about any nail damage, allergies or suspected infections before your appointment.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I bring a picture of a design I want?</summary><p>Yes, please do. Book your treatment with the matching nail art tier, and book detailed or 3D designs in advance.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What’s your cancellation or late policy?</summary><p>A £10 deposit secures your booking and comes off your total. With at least 48 hours’ notice, it moves to your new appointment; with less, it’s kept. There’s a 15-minute grace period for late arrivals, and missed appointments are charged in full.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Is nail art included in the price?</summary><p>No, nail art is added by tier, from £5 for one design type to from £20 for sculpted 3D characters.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Do you do pedicures and toenail extensions?</summary><p>Yes. Express gel pedicures are £30 and deluxe pedicures £40, and polygel toenail extensions are available as a full set or single nails.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I bring a friend or my children?</summary><p>Yes, guests and children are welcome. Just let me know first.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band beige" id="find-us">
    <div class="wrap find">
      <div><img src="/images/shop.webp" alt="The Amour Hair Co. shopfront at 7 Broadwater Street East, Worthing" loading="lazy" width="1122" height="648"></div>
      <div>
        <h2>Find Blush</h2>
        <p class="lede">Inside Amour Hair Co., at number 7 on Broadwater Street East.</p>
        <dl>
          <dt>Address</dt><dd><address>7 Broadwater Street East, Worthing BN14 9AA</address></dd>
          <dt>Phone</dt><dd><a href="tel:+447395586651">07395 586651</a></dd>
          <dt>Hours</dt><dd><div class="hours"><span>Mon to Fri</span><span>9am to 6pm</span><span>Saturday</span><span>10am to 5pm</span><span>Sunday</span><span>Closed</span></div></dd>
          <dt>Parking</dt><dd>Park outside the salon for up to an hour. For longer appointments, there’s parking nearby.</dd>
        </dl>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn" href="https://l.fresha.com/30x4xv43y">Book on Fresha</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Blush+Nail+Room+7+Broadwater+Street+East+Worthing+BN14+9AA">Open in Google Maps</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band blush close">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="notch">
        <p class="display">An hour that’s completely about you.</p>
        <p>Pick a time that suits you. You’ll get instant confirmation from Fresha.</p>
        <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="https://l.fresha.com/30x4xv43y">Book on Fresha</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
</Base>
